    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86871" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προβώμιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωμός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>before</i> or <i>in front of the altar,</i> prob.in
				<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Pae.</u>
				9
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				131
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφαγαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					376
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προβώμια, τά,</span>
			<i>space in front of an altar,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				79
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>placed on the altar beforehand</i> (as a preliminary
			sacrifice), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Berl.Sitzb.</u>
				1927.161
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cyrene</span>).</div>
